# disk-gc.map: Kiln's class map for rnd/DISK-POLICY.md, read by disk-gc.sh. Built 2026-10-02 by Kiln.
# One TAB-separated line per path: host  path  class  kind  queue  restore
#   host  mini (path relative to ~ on MINI_HOST, must be under boar/) | macbook (absolute, under <workspace>/{builds,wt})
#   class A closed line · B reproducible build output · D active (kept) · E unknown (kept, listed for r4to). Only A/B are ever deleted.
#   kind  rm (rm -rf) · apk (sha256 logged, the .apk only, sidecar .sha256 kept) · archive-rm (tar the tree's own scripts/runs to
#         <runner>/kiln/gc-archive/<name>.tgz, then rm -rf) · wt (git worktree remove --force; the diff must still hash to the patch sha) · keep
#   queue the rnd/research/QUEUE.md line (Lnnn as of 2026-10-02) or why the class applies
#   restore how to get it back (recipe in git). kind wt only: a 7th column = the expected sha256 prefix of `git diff HEAD --binary`
